scenario.en:
@EventPattern('order.shipped')
async onShipped(@Payload() e: { orderId: string }) {
  await this.mailer.sendShipped(e.orderId);     // side effect 1
  await this.stats.increment('shipped_count');  // side effect 2
}

The consumer processes the event, then its pod is rotated before the offset commit lands, so the broker redelivers the SAME event once. What does the customer receive and what is shipped_count after both deliveries?

